@startuml adaptation-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (adaptation-service) - FR-08\nOwner: Yomna Mohamed Fekry
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IAdaptation <<provided>> {
  +checkProgress(goalId): ProgressStatus
  +getRecommendations(goalId): List<Recommendation>
  +respond(recId, decision, edits): void
}

class AdaptationService <<component>> {
  -scheduling: IScheduling
  -repository: IRecommendationRepository
  -behindScheduleDetector: BehindScheduleDetector
  -recommendationBuilder: RecommendationBuilder
  --
  +checkProgress(...) / getRecommendations(...)
  +respond(...)
}

IAdaptation <|.. AdaptationService
class BehindScheduleDetector <<component>> {
  +isBehind(tasks): boolean
}
AdaptationService --> BehindScheduleDetector
class RecommendationBuilder <<component>> {
  +build(tasks): List<Recommendation>
}
AdaptationService --> RecommendationBuilder

interface IScheduling <<required - Scheduling service>> {
  +scheduleTasks(studentId): Schedule
  +getConflicts(studentId): List<Conflict>
  +suggestSlots(taskId): List<TimeSlot>
  +moveTask(taskId, slot): void
  +markDone(taskId, done): void
  +getScheduledTasks(studentId, range): List<ScheduledTask>
}

AdaptationService --> IScheduling
interface IRecommendationRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Recommendation): void
  +findById(id): Recommendation
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Recommendation>
}

AdaptationService --> IRecommendationRepository
class Recommendation {
  -recId: String
  -goalId: String
  -type: String
  -newSlot: TimeSlot
  -status: String
  --
  +apply(): void
}
enum ProgressStatus {
  OnTrack
  BehindSchedule
}
IRecommendationRepository --> Recommendation
Recommendation ..> ProgressStatus
note bottom of AdaptationService
SOLID applied:
S - AdaptationService only coordinates; BehindScheduleDetector, RecommendationBuilder each do one job.
O - Nothing is applied until the student accepts, rejects or modifies a recommendation.
L - AdaptationService can replace any other IAdaptation implementation.
I - IAdaptation has only the operations its clients use.
D - AdaptationService depends on interfaces (IScheduling, IRecommendationRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
